---
import Tiktok from "../../assets/icons/Tiktok.astro";
import Twitch from "../../assets/icons/Twitch.astro";
import Twitter from "../../assets/icons/Twitter.astro";
import Download from "../../assets/icons/Download.astro";
---

<div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-10 bg-white mt-10 md:flex-row dark:bg-[#121212]">
  <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center flex-col md:w-[30%]">
    <ul class="w-[200px] py-1 px-2 rounded-xl justify-between flex gap-2 border border-[#69696973] bg-stone-200 dark:bg-[#2f2f2f65] md:w-full">
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@armandocode" target="_blank" aria-label="Find more about my content on Tiktok">
          <Tiktok class="fill-black/80 dark:fill-white duration-100 hover:fill-pink-600" />
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/armandocodecr" target="_blank" aria-label="Find more about my live content on Twitch">
          <Twitch class="fill-black/80 dark:fill-white duration-100 hover:fill-[#8B44F7]" />
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://x.com/Armando_Code" target="_blank" aria-label="Find more about my content on X">
          <Twitter class="fill-black/80 dark:fill-white duration-100 hover:fill-black" />
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <picture class="flex mt-1 justify-center p-1 w-[200px] items-center rounded-lg border border-[#69696973] bg-stone-200 dark:bg-[#2f2f2f65] md:w-full">
        <img
          src="/foto.webp"
          alt="my profile"
          width="1200"
          height="1600"
          class="object-cover rounded-lg w-[200px] md:w-full"
        />
    </picture>
    <a 
      href="/download/Curriculum.pdf"
      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
      target='_blank'
      class="w-[200px] py-1 px-2 rounded-xl mt-1 justify-center font-medium flex gap-2 border border-[#69696973] bg-stone-200 dark:bg-[#2f2f2f65] md:w-full"
    >
      <Download />
      Curriculum
    </a>
  </div>
  <article class="w-full flex flex-col gap-5 justify-center items-center md:w-[70%]">
    <p>
      👨‍💻 23 years old. I'm from 🇨🇷. Since I was young, technology and computers have always caught my attention. Today, after years of preparation, I'm experiencing my first professional experiences as a <em class="text-yellow-500 inline dark:text-yellow-300">Software Developer</em> and being co-founder and programmer of a great <em class="text-green-500 inline dark:text-green-300">Web3</em> product called 
      <a href="https://www.trustlesswork.com/" target="_blank" class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Trustless Work</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Personally, <em class="text-orange-500 inline dark:text-orange-300">I'm fulfilled being part of the process of solving real problems</em>. I started as a developer in a company where I learned to build with impact, and today I continue that growth as <strong>co-founder</strong> of 
      <a href="https://www.trustlesswork.com/" target="_blank" class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Trustless Work</a>, 
      a secure payment platform with blockchain technology. Each stage has been key to shaping me and continuing to grow both personally and professionally.
    </p>
    <p>
      One of my greatest virtues is that I'm a person who <em class="text-sky-500 inline">always seeks to adapt to different situations or challenges that arise</em>. I'm capable of learning and solving whatever I set my mind to on my own, as for me, constant learning is one of the most necessary skills to grow and be valuable within the <em class="text-yellow-500 dark:text-yellow-300">Software Development</em> industry.
    </p>
  </article>
</div>   

<style>
  .cr-strong{
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(20,38,190,1) 9%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 44%, rgba(208,0,0,1) 80%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
</style>